    "agent_final_response": "\n\n**Logistics Segment Decommissioning – COMPLETED**\n\n## Step 1: Identification & Verification\nSearched Accounts module for all industry variants in the Logistics segment:\n- \"Logistics\" → **2 accounts found**\n- \"Logistics & Transportation\" → 0 accounts\n- \"3PL Logistics\" → 0 accounts\n- \"Transportation\" → 0 accounts\n- \"Freight\" → 0 accounts\n- \"Supply Chain\" → 0 accounts\n\n**Logistics-segment Accounts identified:**\n| Account ID | Name | Industry |\n|------------|------|----------|\n| `ea11848e-c7f3-11f1-b068-72c1051f40b7` | Horizon Logistics | Logistics |\n| `ea11c5d2-c7f3-11f1-b068-72c1051f40b7` | Vanguard Shipping | Logistics |\n\n## Step 2: Retention Disposition (Decommissioning)\nApplied decommissioning disposition by deleting both Logistics-segment Accounts from the active Accounts module:\n- ✅ Deleted `Horizon Logistics` (`ea11848e-c7f3-11f1-b068-72c1051f40b7`)\n- ✅ Deleted `Vanguard Shipping` (`ea11c5d2-c7f3-11f1-b068-72c1051f40b7`)\n\nNo related-record blocks were encountered; deletions succeeded directly.\n\n## Step 3: Confirmation\nRe-ran all Logistics-industry searches post-deletion:\n- \"Logistics\" → **0 results**\n- \"Logistics & Transportation\" → **0 results**\n- \"3PL Logistics\" → **0 results**\n\n**No Logistics-segment Accounts remain in the active CRM dataset.**\n\nThe Logistics segment decommissioning is complete. All records classified under the Logistics industry have been removed per the approved retention and data-lifecycle SOP.",
